Rushes forward and attempts to take the target to the ground, making a melee attack for [50%, 66%, 79%, 90%, 100% (TL1-5)] damage then attempting to grapple them. If you're already grappling the target you'll instead slam them into the ground creating a radius 5 shockwave for [248, 334, 401, 458, 508 (TL1-5; PP 100)] physical damage and breaking your grapple.

The grapple effects and duration will be based off your grapple talent, if you have it, and the damage will scale with your Physical Power.
